Request Description:
Relating to Housing Targets/Completions for 2024 Request for any briefings/memos/talking points prepared for the then minister
- Regarding a report by Deutsche Numis Research predicting that more than 40,000 new homes would be built in Ireland last year;
- Regarding a report by Ernst Young/Euroconstruct about the number of new homes that would be built in Ireland last year;
- Between August and December in which housing targets or expected completions referenced for 2024.
- Correspondence between the minister's office and the office of An Taoiseach between August and December 2024 in which housing targets were mentioned
